{1}{[The guard addresses you gruffly.] Citizen, this is no place for you. Move along.}{[The guard addresses you gruffly.] Citizen, this is no place for you. Move along.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{What is happening here?}{}{5}{}{10}{}
{9}{I'm leaving.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{10}{Have you not been reading the newspapers? There's a murderer on the loose. This is where one of his grisly murders occurred.}{Have you not been reading the newspapers? There's a murderer on the loose. This is where one of his grisly murders occurred.}{}{}{}{}
{11}{Perhaps I can help find the murderer.}{}{5}{}{20}{}
