{31}{Thanks.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{40}{Distasteful business, this. Cuts 'em up like a surgeon, he does. Not much else to tell, really.}{Distasteful business, this. Cuts 'em up like a surgeon, he does. Not much else to tell, really.}{}{}{}{}
